---
title: "createGeneration (stem-bot-v2: src/api/generation.ts)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_validate: generation = req.body.generation
    q_validate --> q_err_input: !generation
    q_validate --> q_check_exists: generation provided
    q_err_input --> [*]: res.status(400)
    q_check_exists --> q_err_conflict: existingRole found in DB
    q_check_exists --> q_create_role: no existing role
    q_err_conflict --> [*]: res.status(409) already exists
    q_create_role --> q_err_discord: createRole failed (null)
    q_create_role --> q_save_db: role created on Discord
    q_err_discord --> [*]: res.status(500)
    q_save_db --> q_err_insert: insertError
    q_save_db --> q_respond: insert success
    q_err_insert --> [*]: res.status(500)
    q_respond --> [*]: res.json(success, role_id, generation)

    note right of q_validate
        INV-001: generation is not type-checked (truthy check only, 0 would be rejected)
        INV-002: No upper/lower bound validation on generation number
    end note

    note right of q_create_role
        INV-003: Discord role creation and DB insert are not atomic (role created but DB insert could fail, leaving orphan Discord role)
        INV-004: TOCTOU between existence check and insert (race condition)
    end note
